    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "summer_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I like seeing all the tropical plants this time of year. The valley gets so lush.",
      "translation": "V tomhle období rád pozoruju všechny tropické rostliny. Údolí je tak bujné.",
      "sourceSHA256": "976c9a8b018eefd2cf7884834ce1f1d10c7c53b75c9c0f46795e2e38f1bc4c5b",
      "translationSHA256": "47e86722c5cdb9db1c0505aacb5fd757870026dce229078a404f665fcfe7f551",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "summer_10",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I might fast until the luau tomorrow. I need the ol' bag to be empty so I can fill it with piping hot soup.$h",
      "translation": "Možná budu až do zítřejšího Luau držet půst. Můj starý vak musí být prázdný, abych ho mohl naplnit vroucí polévkou.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "c3de7c9c620729b38157d1c99eb021014a12196e4eb472c39e261b7d94635c43",
      "translationSHA256": "8d34872d61d8619828e8901ea9f1c3e5ee23e331fba4c93f001940e8b39f3bc2",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "summer_27",
      "field": null,
      "source": "What are your plans for the fall? I'm going to try and incorporate more wine into my diet.",
      "translation": "Jaké máš plány na podzim? Pokusím se do svého jídelníčku zařadit víc vína.",
      "sourceSHA256": "6d4d3896d491f4451bc4e430b785a7e75c06a66fbd88c04a88600bfa53d925bc",
      "translationSHA256": "89199d1575b091d12ebc9924d7f4508128f70626f5fc7d8f0af64b77cbb4e35c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "fall_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hmm... I might have to buy a few cases of pumpkin ale to celebrate the season...$6",
      "translation": "Hmm... Možná budu muset na oslavu tohoto období koupit pár beden dýňového piva...$6",
      "sourceSHA256": "ac65cb9d9139ef590fbac8a10f52096ed5869e738bcc400ca18f3c92d72cd419",
      "translationSHA256": "5e0f98eb631b0acdcac9afdcbe550733f983b417e9e60f4b7d7d2876a7993082",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
